lue\":\"## 天津出差工作总结报告\\n\\n- **出差时间**：2026-07-20 至 2026-07-25 (共 6 天)\\n- **出差人员**：陈浩\\n- **主要目的地**：天津\\n- **归属项目**：X2607-001\\n\\n### 一、主要任务与工作成果\\n1. 赴 天津 据点开展现场系统导入与技术需求对齐，完成了业务场景与系统接口的技术论证；\\n2. 会同客户项目组进行联合联调测试，梳理并闭环关键业务用例；\\n3. 现场举行系统交接与培训会，收集现场反馈并形成后续迭代待办清单。\\n\\n### 二、后续跟进计划\\n- 推进联调遗留事项整改，完成交付物归档与验收；\\n- 持续关注客户运行环境稳定性，提供线上技术支持。\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"UPDATE_DATE\":{\"dataType\":\"DATE\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"2026-09-17T17:05:47\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"BILL_DEFINE_ID\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"035a50ee6d3de1653e55bb00bc610001\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"F_CZX\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"天津\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"BILL_MAIN_ID\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"048932554eed099e7e972c0633570000\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"F_YJ\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"天津业务差旅与实地调研 (住理工津荣模具、環宇住理工、東海化成)\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"F_TOQJ\":{\"dataType\":\"DATE\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"2026-07-25T19:01\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"CREATE_DATE\":{\"dataType\":\"DATE\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"2026-09-17T17:05:47\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"VERSION\":{\"dataType\":\"NUMBER\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":1,\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"BILL_ROW_ID\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"04893255536d099e7e972c063357000a\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"BILL_PARENT_ID\":{\"dataType\":\"STEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"048932554eed099e7e972c0633570000\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"F_QJFROM\":{\"dataType\":\"DATE\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"2026-07-20T12:35\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"},\"F_BG\":{\"dataType\":\"MTEXT\",\"initValueType\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"value\":\"天津业务差旅与实地调研 (住理工津荣模具、環宇住理工、東海化成)\",\"valueCipher\":\"\"}},\"parentId\":\"048932554